16
00:00:39,360 --> 00:00:42,480
Now, you can directly ask the interviewers about Merge Sort.

17
00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:44,960
The logic behind Merge Sort is very important,

18
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:46,960
which is also used in other problems.

19
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:48,880
The algorithm, the process of learning,

20
00:00:48,880 --> 00:00:51,640
the divide and conquer is used in many algorithms.

21
